text = "A burning kingdom cries out from the ash,  
	The ember heart bleeds a name.  
		A shadow that cannot return,  
			The great Cinderfell is no longer the same.  
				So flee into darkness and fear;  
					the broken voices herald an ending clear.

												- Silem the Gilded One   

"
